This product includes optional tooling for the FewRel dataset maintained by THUNLP. JevGraph does
not redistribute FewRel. Users download it directly from its upstream repository and must preserve
the upstream license, attribution, and citation requirements.

The optional `documents` extra installs DocJev, created by Jerry Liu and the LlamaIndex community,
at pinned revision
9ed0fe05984ce1906af9272b8b400c8d46520f98. DocJev and its LiteParse dependency are distributed
under their own open-source licenses. JevGraph uses DocJev only for local document conversion and
OCR; it does not invoke DocJev's hosted classification or splitting pipeline.
